title: Act2_ShopBanter_Family
---
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve shy>>
Eve: Dad likes to act tough, but he’s really just a big softie inside.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: He mentioned you had a sister?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve sad>>
Eve: ...
Eve: Ava.
Eve: She’s not here anymore.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus sad>>
Cyrus: Oh...I’m sorry.

<<jump Act2_ShopBanter_End>>
===


title: Act2_ShopBanter_Dispatcher
---
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happy>>
Eve: Scared I’m gonna get you killed?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: This is my first time officially, but I’ve helped Hunters before. Patching gear, pointing them to jobs, you name it.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultSpeak>>
Cyrus: Why’d you decide to be a dispatcher now?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyTalk>>
Eve: I’ve always wanted to do more to help around here, and you looked like you were going to get yourself killed without someone watching your back.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus smile>>
Cyrus: Won’t argue with that.

<<jump Act2_ShopBanter_End>>
===


title: Act2_ShopBanter_Prism
---
<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: Is it always this tense around here?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: Lately? Yeah. Memory monsters keep spawning faster than we can kill them. And like Tobias said, a lot of people don’t trust each other anymore.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: You think he’s right, that it’s all just paranoia?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve eyeclosedTalk>>
Eve: ...I think the one thing this city needs right now is a united front.

<<jump Act2_ShopBanter_End>>
===


title: Act2_ShopBanter_Eve
---

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyEyeclosedTalk>>
Eve: Oooh, watching movies! But recently- Dad thinks it’s silly- I’ve been getting into making things out of the scraps laying around the shop.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus surprised>>
Cyrus: You mean the sculptures? You made these?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve happyTalk>>
Eve: They’re a work in progress. I like to find a purpose for misfit things, rather than just throw them out.
Eve: What about you? Got any hobbies?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: ...
Cyrus: Good question.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve confused>>
Eve: Huh? It’s not like you were just born today.

<<jump Act2_ShopBanter_End>>
===


title: Act2_ShopBanter_End
---
<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve shock>>
: [i]ding[/i]
Eve: That was fast, your first mission’s already here.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: Already? Who’s it from?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve defaultTalk>>
Eve: It’s a commission from the government.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultSpeak>>
Cyrus: So are Hunters not directly affiliated with the government?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: No, not really. You’d never be directly in contact with anyone from the government except for short term contracts. 
Eve: Honestly, I don’t know much about them. They prefer to stay in their lofty towers rather than around town.
===


title: Act2_PoliceContact_PreCombat_P2N6
---

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Cyrus! Didn’t expect to see you so soon! Looks like every Hunter is getting sent out here.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultSpeak>>
Cyrus: What commission is it? 

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Government commission. Prooobably the mayor’s orders. We all know the Council doesn't have any real power.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: [i]The mayor, huh.[/i]

<<set_portrait YarnManager Saul>>
Saul: Well, gotta go! See ya around!
===


title: Act2_PoliceContact_PostCombat_P2N6
---

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus eyesclosed>>
Cyrus: Hey Eve, your voice is lagging from my end. I’m going to try to restart the device. Give me a few minutes.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve default>>
Eve: Huh? Oh, okay. Be careful!

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: [i]Hmmm, this should allow me to contact Prismatic Security.[/i]

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
???: The moon falls.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: And a new dawn rises.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
???: What are you calling to report?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultSpeak>>
Cyrus: There’s a False Human within the upper ranks of the government. I suspect it may be the mayor, or one of their close confidants.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
???: ...

???: And what makes you so sure of this?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angry>>
Cyrus: He- well the government just dispatched all the Hunters deep into the outskirts; the city’s been left undefended for something terrible.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
???: We require more concrete evidence in order to investigate such a case.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus angrySpeak>>
Cyrus: Look, I know it sounds crazy, but if I’m wrong, you lose an hour. If I’m right, you lose a city.

<<clear_portrait YarnManager>>
: [i]signal cut[/i]

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: [i]How am I supposed to warn people about something that hasn’t happened yet?[/i]

===


