title: Act2_EveMeeting_P2N9
---
/// no repeat
<<set_cg YarnManager 0>>

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve shock>>
Eve: Oh, Cyrus! Didn’t think you’d be back this soon.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus defaultSpeak>>
Cyrus: Has anything happened yet?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve confused>>
Eve: Uh...no?

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus eyesclosed>>
Cyrus: That’s good to hear. Don’t go anywhere until I’m back.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve angry>>
Eve: Wait, where are you going?
Eve: If this has something to do with the monsters, you need to let your dispatcher know. It’s too risky to go out on your own.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus lookAway>>
Cyrus: Trust me. If you stay here, you’ll be safe.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve angry>>
Eve: What are you- Your gear is gonna break! At least let me fix that.

<<set_portrait YarnManager Cyrus default>>
Cyrus: There’s no time. 

<<set_portrait YarnManager Eve angry>>
Eve: Hey! You-
Eve: ...And he’s gone.
===


